# ===============================================
# .gitignore —— 写在这里的文件/文件夹，Git 永远不管
# ===============================================

# --- Keil 编译产物（每次编译都会变，不能进仓库）---
Objects/
Listings/
DebugConfig/
*.o
*.d
*.crf
*.axf
*.hex
*.bin
*.map
*.lst
*.sct
*.dep
*.lnp
*.htm
*.iex
*.build_log.htm

# --- 手动备份文件 ---
*.bak
*.bak2
*.bak3
*.gbk.bak

# --- 个人配置（含 Windows 用户名和本地路径）---
*.uvguix.*
*.uvoptx

# --- IDE 临时文件 ---
*.scvd
*.log
JLinkLog.txt

# --- 系统垃圾 ---
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
